<title>FRANCE: France's Arthuis sees gas tax rise with inflation.</title>
<headline>France's Arthuis sees gas tax rise with inflation.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis said on Friday that the increase in the excise duties on petrol would be in line with inflation.</p>
<p>Speaking in a radio interview, he said the increase would be &quot;in proportion with inflation...no more.&quot;</p>
<p>France raises duties on petrol in line with inflation every year.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
